 pour zoomer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-aHMiV1D6UoQ7kNvwFE-J5_&_nc_oc=AdptFgwFg6KaWNxdTnVff_f5FR2EWEpGiSmEs0EOPn4dn67pBe-UOH21FQnx3fVHINE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE_U7kD77Br92-kMoS9gSzFvJvwB6rvepSRPYKU41yO9Q&oe=6A8D7AF4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tU-NoZ1SiMYQ7kNvwGFOfOY&_nc_oc=AdrUJWQaKOOED054nfPkKkMQzANRyvwlxJ2ZqtSgug9VtgpUgi8MOlY6KMFovlDaa6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG40G3NIoxKWYD8VI19NlRx52Bp-axqNkAI7acUYEr9bg&oe=6A8D7C56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kScf1PZ9lzoQ7kNvwEtvzbB&_nc_oc=Adq0kv16S61_L4IPTWCU4s-A1byKTu3O2NHfStf5MTzEYRmVcfywpmI9d5fUPsq919M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGvfT6cxSaGQJdzWkDvlJvJ_cq4IecR8NTJwSysQ0XfDA&oe=6A8D9177"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri":